{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-09_beg","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-09","title":"再見，只為再見","storyCode":"M8-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"7b9aeb30bdc91026cf0cc28c976f1c2ff8b9c5a7c7b41ce33937da8800948bd8","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topout"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"攔在指揮塔下，你是哪裡的整合運動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"是加入，還是逃跑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你要與我們作戰，我們也不會攔你！但是這既可恥又毫無意義！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......你見過這支小隊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。自從走出雪原，大多數整合運動的新血液，我都沒興趣認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼覺得，他們並不像是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Guard！當心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"（暗號）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯軍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"唔咳......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"後撤！！是烏薩斯軍人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你到死都一個字也不會說，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你心裡想著我是叛徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"想著我們居然敢離開烏薩斯的大軍，投奔卑賤的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"為了他們毫無價值的生命而戰，我們既不識時務也不榮譽，所以我們的名字該從所有名冊中抹去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你有丈夫或者妻子，你明明不想但還是被你的上級送到這裡等死，做陰謀家的棋子，把自己的命丟給別人用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"可悲！可悲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你殺過烏薩斯人嗎？你殺的是感染者還是市民？你手上沾血有沒有覺得害怕，你晚上是不是睡不著覺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"先皇死後......還留在那裡的你們這些傢伙......都......可悲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"別死撐著！快後退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！烏薩斯軍穿上了整合運動的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不，Guard！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能這麼說......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你這麼說，敵人和我們都會懷疑起自己周圍的人......局勢越混亂越方便他們行事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"極境的推測要是沒錯，那我們首先就只能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"阻擋住任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"可已經沒多少時間了，我們不知道什麼時候整合運動就會湧向指揮塔......那時候我們只會更難組織進攻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們不需要所有人都加入這場戰鬥。對抗塔露拉，不成軍隊建制的小隊是沒有用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"後退，後退！當心破城矛的射擊！找掩護！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭......你又要......你可是羅德島的領導人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不敢說“那我就更應該去了”......我只能說，如果一件事只有我能做，如果一件事需要被完成，那麼我會去做，我會去完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島近衛幹員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"那誰來掩護你們的行動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"盾衛們，你們的傷患也動起來，把陣線穩住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"菲林......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"他們還在驅趕那些特殊的感染者，牧群。狠毒。他們沒有一點仁慈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我來毀掉他們的陣地和伏擊點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"......好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"菲林，受烏薩斯盾衛和遊擊隊戰士支援的外人，你是第一個！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年紀尚幼的術師抬起手。戰場的嘈雜聲響好像與她無關，她目不斜視。她目光如炬。\n此前，她的惶恐與她的痛惜使她不斷追逐著她不斷流逝的記憶。\n現在，她與友人的約定，她與這些鋼鐵牆垛共同的責任，令她停步，令她站定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不是外人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在是一支隊伍。我們要停下這座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，不是外人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"盾衛！架盾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]}]}
